    "text": "Let $\\mathbb{R}$ denote the set of all real numbers. Then the area of the region $\\left\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathbb{R} \\times \\mathbb{R}: x>0, y>\\frac{1}{x}, 5 x-4 y-1>0,4 x+4 y-17 <0\\right\\}$ is"
